  "2026-10-25T08:46:20.559Z",codex-agent,"Final Bun release:check also passed all 12 stages: 137/137 suite tests, 2/2 packed installation journeys, no skipped/cancelled/todo tests, and 100% in every coverage dimension for every inventoried file. npm and Bun ran sequentially with isolated HOME and Git configuration. Code is 3f2b058; remaining changes are tracker receipts only. Main has the scaffold commit; no remote exists and no push, release or publication was attempted. Remote backend certification is tracked by blocked pm-hypothesis-backend."
